Design and fix the renumber path so that no event of a renumber-rejected create is ever applied under the old number:
(a) The hub, or the push path, refuses or holds every same-batch or later event that depends on a create_node the hub rejected for renumber: the same node, its children, and dependencies on it.
(b) After Store.RenumberSubtree, every PENDING event of the renumbered subtree is rewritten to the new ids before it is pushed, or re-emitted under them.
(c) Pull never applies a teammate's events to a local task that holds the same number but a different uid, or a pending, unpushed create.
